      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE Lettings are delighted to present this spacious and well-maintained three-bedroom, two-storey semi-detached home to the rental market. Ideally positioned on a quiet cul-de-sac, this excellent property offers comfortable family living with the added benefit of a private front and side garden featuring a unique gated entrance.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall leading to a bright and spacious living room, a fully fitted kitchen complete with a new oven/grill and electric hob, a separate utility room, three generous double bedrooms and a fully tiled family bathroom with both a bath and shower. New carpets are due to be fitted prior to tenancy.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include gas-fired central heating, double-glazed windows, a fully alarmed security system, ample parking, and high-quality appliances throughout.\r\n\r\nThe property enjoys an excellent location close to Tallaght Village and Citywest Shopping Centre, with a wide selection of schools, shops, cafés, and local amenities nearby. The LUAS Red Line is within walking distance, providing easy access to Dublin City Centre, while a variety of sports clubs and recreational facilities are also close by.\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\n•Spacious three-bedroom semi-detached home\r\n•Gas-fired central heating\r\n•Double-glazed windows\r\n•Fully alarmed\r\n•Can come fully furnished or unfurnished \r\n•Fully fitted kitchen with new oven/grill and electric hob\r\n•Three double bedrooms \r\n•Fully tiled bathroom with bath and shower\r\n•Private front and side gardens with gated entrance\r\n•Ample parking\r\n•Excellent location close to Tallaght Village, Citywest Shopping Centre and the LUAS\r\n•Available to rent immediately"
      },
